<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-ignore-files-and-folders">
    <title>Ignore files and folders</title>
    <body>
    <p>To ignore multiple files and folders at the same time, go to <uicontrol
        conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs0-git-staging-view"/>
      <b>></b>
      <uicontrol conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs1-unstaged-files"/> and
      follow these steps:</p><ol id="ul_sxx_yrd_mjc">
      <li>Hold down <uicontrol>Ctrl</uicontrol> and select the files and folders you want to ignore. </li>
      <li>Right-click an untracked file or folder to open the contextual menu and select <uicontrol
          conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/>. </li>
    </ol>
    <p>
      <fig id="fig_qtj_myd_mjf">
        <title>Ignoring multiple files and folders</title>
        <?oxy_comment_start author="adrian_lapadat" timestamp="20260608T155827+0300" comment="repl w/ files and folders ss to demo f&apos;nality"?>
        <image href="../img/git-addon/staging/ignore/ignore-multiple.png" id="image_gmv_yyd_mjc"
        /><?oxy_comment_end?>
      </fig>
    </p>
    <p>The untracked files and folders' paths are added to the project's
      <codeph>.gitignore</codeph>. </p>
  </body>
</topic>
